cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data or code, please cite it as below, and credit the Centre for Research and Studies in Legal Informatics, Lebanese University, for the legal texts."
type: dataset
title: "Lebanese Legislation: the relational database of Lebanese law"
abstract: "Lebanese laws, decrees, court rulings and Official Gazette issues in Arabic and French, with the amendment, repeal and citation links between texts: Parquet tables, a PostgreSQL database, a JSON API and an MCP server. The legal texts are from the Centre for Research and Studies in Legal Informatics, Lebanese University."
authors:
  - name: "Taktek, LLC"
    website: "https://taktek.io"
repository-code: "https://github.com/taktekhq/lebanese-legislation"
repository: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/taktekhq/lebanese-legislation"
url: "https://lebaneselegislation.com/data/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Lebanon
  - Lebanese law
  - legislation
  - legal data
  - Official Gazette
  - court rulings
  - Arabic
  - open data
  - MCP
